# Local-only engineering docs and automated tests (since v0.5.0).
# Product/architecture/iteration documents and test suites now stay in the
# maintainer's working copy. Paths that were already tracked remain tracked;
# new ones are not published. README, LICENSE, README screenshots and the
# docs bundled into release packages stay public.
/docs/*
!/docs/release/
!/docs/images/
